<title>SWEDEN: CUSTOS BIDS FOR ASG STAKE.</title>
<headline>CUSTOS BIDS FOR ASG STAKE.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish investment company AB Custos said on Monday it placed a bid on all shares in AB Transportforvaltning, an unlisted company whose main asset is a stake in Swedish transport group ASG.</p>
<p>AB Transportforvaltning holds 27.1 percent of votes and 16.5 percent of capital in ASG, Custos said in a statement.</p>
<p>Shareholders representing 68 percent of shares in AB Transportforvaltning have so far accepted the bid, Custos said without disclosing how much it is offering for the company.</p>
<p>-- Birgitta Forsberg, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
